# Solreign "Mandatory Team-Building Exercise" — acid-green corporate HR voice.

# Popup on first pickup (the exercise arms).
solreign-hot-potato-armed = The exercise chirps warmly: "Congratulations on volunteering!"

# Popup when a collision hand-off succeeds.
solreign-hot-potato-passed = { $from } delegates the exercise to { $to }. Synergy achieved!

# Examine text before the exercise is armed.
solreign-hot-potato-examine-idle = A pristine morale device. The label reads: "Simply pick up to opt in. Opting out is not a recognized workflow."

# Examine text while the fuse is running.
solreign-hot-potato-examine-armed = Exercise concludes in approximately { $seconds } seconds. HR thanks you in advance for your flexibility.
